    "body": "The installed trace proves the prior repair failed: inventory became active, but the settled physical readback stayed `physical=0`, so there is no key/button for you to press. The source omitted Rockstar's `_SET_ACTIVE_META_PED_COMPONENTS_UPDATED` commit between enabling the holster component and rebuilding the ped, and it also had the default LOADOUT_3 address wrong. Both are corrected from `act_hunting_2.c:50951-50965`; combined development build `D7BCACD0748735BC03766D4A1483DAD96BD1C09EF01196CC70C195BD42EE476C` is queued for automatic installation after RDR2 closes. This remains actionable until that install lands.\r\n",
